{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026IQbpic8Haq1790063102.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">財政司司長陳茂波聯同財金官員在北京訪問金融機構。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳茂波到訪投資銀行中金公司，並與董事長陳亮會面。財庫局局長許正宇和金管局總裁余偉文亦有參與。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BJ.FS-1300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026THi4Dk3rTx1790063110.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BJ.FS-1300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳茂波期望中金公司繼續與香港金融監管機構保持緊密溝通，積極參與本港資本市場高質量發展，並拓展國際業務，特別是進一步連接「一帶一路」沿線國家的市場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳茂波一行人其後結束北京訪問行程返港。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T08:24:11.059450+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}